          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Our mission",
            "row_content": "<p>At Monthlies, we aim to help all women have a pain-free period, while providing the best possible care for their overall well-being. Above all, this means getting \"WOW\" results.<br/></p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "question-1": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Our expertise",
            "row_content": "<p>Our team of female experts and in-house naturopathic doctors, is dedicated to putting science first in everything we do. We pride ourselves on product curation and development focused on research.</p><p>We deliver natural products with premium formulas that target specific period pains and cycle needs.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "question-2": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Our delivery policy",
            "row_content": "<p>We currently offer shipping throughout Germany and France. </p><p>We strive to ship and deliver your order as quickly and efficiently as possible.</p><p>Your order will be processed within 1-2 business days at which time you will receive a confirmation email with a tracking number. From there, our standard shipping times range from 3-5 business days.</p><p><em>If you have any questions, please write to us at info@monthlies.com</em></p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
      },
