            "heading": "What's inside the box",
            "row_content": "<p><strong>Broccoli Extract </strong>(<em>60 capsules)</em></p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Ingredients</span></p><p><em>100% Broccoli Extract, from which 10% is sulforaphane.</em></p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Dietary information:</span></p><ul><li>100% natural </li><li>Lactose Free </li><li>Gluten Free </li><li>Vegan </li><li>GMO Free </li></ul><p></p><p><strong>Ginger </strong>(3 patches with a size of 22 x 9.5 cm)</p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Ingredients</span></p><p><em>Iron powder, water, activated carbon, wood flour, salt</em></p><p><strong>Radiance Tea</strong> (<em>20 tea bags)</em></p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Ingredients</span></p><p><em>Vitamins B1, B2,B3,B5, B6, B12</em></p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Dietary information:</span></p><ul><li>Soy Free</li><li>Lactose Free </li><li>Gluten Free </li><li>Vegan </li><li>Suitable for breastfeeding and pregnant women</li></ul>",
