        },
        "template--18297717260606__84d8abb4-fa29-413a-8cf4-17500eaeb9a9-167932798684227e83-2": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How to take the products",
            "row_content": "<p><strong>Green tea </strong></p><ul><li>1 cup of tea per day</li></ul><p><strong>Broccoli Extract </strong></p><ul><li>2 capsules per day</li></ul><p><strong>Heat Patches</strong></p><ul><li>Whenever you feel cramps, back or belly pain.</li></ul><p>The heat patch is very flexible and can be glued directly to the skin.</p><p><strong>B Complex </strong></p><ul><li>1 capsule per day during your whole cycle</li></ul>",
